def MedBase(
    *args, **kwargs
):
A class that represents an image object. Metaclass casts x to this class if it is of type cls._bypass_type.
target_spacing, apply_reorder and affine_matrix are CLASS attributes (shared by MedImage/MedMask), set once via item_preprocessing (from MedDataBlock); affine_matrix is latched from the first loaded image and read by spatial augmentation. One dataset per process with uniform reorder+resample before augmentation, so all samples share an affine.

